{
 "function": "protocol.diff",
 "description": "Server half of the delta protocol: a client that applies the frames built from two consecutive states ends up equal to the new state, also when an object field group loses a key (B76, B100). Input: the successive full states of one collection. Expected: the client state after each step, and whether any frame was sent.",
